{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51845","headline":"分柑子歌示诸小 · 无名氏","name":"分柑子歌示诸小","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"痴男騃女愁杀人，偏呼小者大者嗔。\n粗衣粝食尽须一，何况异味兼时新。\n今朝楼下[柑]（甘）初熟，摘得一筐分不足。\n儿童岂待父母施，自各捻来（一作「各自捻将」）献兄叔。\n就中小女有所翳，（下缺）（同上三三七《歌行》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}